      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "adPageSets",
      "Anchor": "adpagesets",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Every page set is owned by a Sponsored Account (advertiser) and describes a pattern (set of pages) on the advertiser\u2019s website. If a user visits a page in this page set, the user can be added to a segment so they can be retargeted later.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Supported Methods",
      "Anchor": "supported-methods",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Supported Methods"
      ],
      "Text": "CREATE | GET | FINDER | PARTIAL_UPDATE",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
